  "description": "EmbeddingGemma 2 ai-embeddings provider for molecule.dev — Google's open (Apache-2.0) multimodal embedding model run in-process via Transformers.js (ONNX): text, images and audio in one 768-d space, task prefixes applied for you, Matryoshka 512/256/128",
